{
  "name": "Place outbound calls",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Before the first run\n\n1. Create an n8n data table named exactly **Call queue**.\n2. Add text columns: phone, customer_name, offer, status, conversation_id, call_sid, called_at, last_error, result_summary.\n3. Add a test row. phone must be E.164, such as +27821234567. status must be pending.\n4. Create three n8n variables: ELEVENLABS_API_KEY, ELEVENLABS_AGENT_ID, ELEVENLABS_AGENT_PHONE_NUMBER_ID.\n5. Import the Twilio number into ElevenLabs with the Account SID and Auth Token. Copy that number's phone number id into ELEVENLABS_AGENT_PHONE_NUMBER_ID. This workflow does not call Twilio itself.\n6. In the ElevenLabs agent prompt, {{customer_name}} and {{offer}} receive the values from the row.\n7. Run this workflow by hand once. An accepted dial sets status to called. A refused dial sets status to failed and stores last_error. Set status back to pending to try a failed row again.\n8. The schedule then takes 3 pending rows every 10 minutes and dials them one at a time. Set the n8n timezone to Africa/Johannesburg and narrow the schedule to calling hours before real use.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b7c1a0e2-4d55-4a1e-9c31-0a6e5f8b2d11",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-520, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "c1e0a9b4-6f22-4c8d-8a71-1b2d3e4f5a01",
      "name": "Run by hand",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 10
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "c1e0a9b4-6f22-4c8d-8a71-1b2d3e4f5a02",
      "name": "Every 10 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [0, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "get",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Call queue"
        },
        "matchType": "allConditions",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "status",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "pending"
            }
          ]
        },
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 3,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1e0a9b4-6f22-4c8d-8a71-1b2d3e4f5a03",
      "name": "Read pending numbers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [280, 180],
      "executeOnce": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1e0a9b4-6f22-4c8d-8a71-1b2d3e4f5a04",
      "name": "One number",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [560, 180]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/convai/twilio/outbound-call",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "xi-api-key",
              "value": "={{ $vars.ELEVENLABS_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ agent_id: $vars.ELEVENLABS_AGENT_ID, agent_phone_number_id: $vars.ELEVENLABS_AGENT_PHONE_NUMBER_ID, to_number: $('One number').item.json.phone, conversation_initiation_client_data: { dynamic_variables: { customer_name: $('One number').item.json.customer_name || '', offer: $('One number').item.json.offer || '' } } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "c1e0a9b4-6f22-4c8d-8a71-1b2d3e4f5a05",
      "name": "Place the call",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [840, 180],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const row = $('One number').item.json;\nconst response = $input.item.json;\nconst nestedError = response.error && (response.error.message || response.error.description);\nconst refused = response.success === false ? (response.message || 'ElevenLabs refused the call') : '';\nconst errorMessage = nestedError || refused || '';\nconst conversationId = response.conversation_id || '';\nconst ok = !errorMessage && conversationId !== '';\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    phone: row.phone,\n    ok,\n    conversation_id: conversationId,\n    call_sid: response.callSid || '',\n    last_error: ok ? '' : (errorMessage || 'No conversation id was returned'),\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "c1e0a9b4-6f22-4c8d-8a71-1b2d3e4f5a06",
      "name": "Read the result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1120, 180]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "call-accepted",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1e0a9b4-6f22-4c8d-8a71-1b2d3e4f5a07",
      "name": "Was the call accepted?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1360, 180]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "update",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Call queue"
        },
        "matchType": "allConditions",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "phone",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $json.phone }}"
            },
            {
              "keyName": "status",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "pending"
            }
          ]
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "status": "called",
            "conversation_id": "={{ $json.conversation_id }}",
            "call_sid": "={{ $json.call_sid }}",
            "called_at": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
            "last_error": ""
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1e0a9b4-6f22-4c8d-8a71-1b2d3e4f5a08",
      "name": "Mark called",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1640, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "update",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Call queue"
        },
        "matchType": "allConditions",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "phone",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $json.phone }}"
            },
            {
              "keyName": "status",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "pending"
            }
          ]
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "status": "failed",
            "last_error": "={{ $json.last_error }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1e0a9b4-6f22-4c8d-8a71-1b2d3e4f5a09",
      "name": "Mark failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1640, 320]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
